5.75 0 0 1-.75-.75Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003eTip\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\nYou can quickly preview a filter's inbox results by creating a query in your inbox view and clicking \u003cstrong\u003eSave\u003c/strong\u003e, which opens the custom filter settings.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdd a name for your filter and a filter query. For example, to only see notifications for a specific repository, you can create a filter using the query \u003ccode\u003erepo:octocat/open-source-project-name reason:participating\u003c/code\u003e. You can also add emojis with a native emoji keyboard. For a list of supported search queries, see \u003ca href=\"/en/subscriptions-and-notifications/reference/inbox-filters\"\u003eInbox filters\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cpicture\u003e\u003csource srcset=\"/assets/cb-72123/mw-1440/images/help/notifications-v2/custom-filter-example.webp 2x\" type=\"image/webp\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/assets/cb-72123/images/help/notifications-v2/custom-filter-example.png\" alt=\"Screenshot showing notification filters. Two input fields, with an example name and filter query filled in, are highlighted with an orange outline.\"\u003e\u003c/picture\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eClick \u003cstrong\u003eCreate\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e","renderedPageHast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"h2","properties":{"id":"prerequisites","tabIndex":-1},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"className":["heading-link"],"href":"#prerequisites"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Prerequisites"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"className":["heading-link-symbol"],"ariaHidden":"true"},"children":[]}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"To use the notifications inbox on GitHub and GitHub Mobile, you must enable notifications for both "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Email"}]},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"On GitHub"}]},{"type":"text","value":" in your notification settings. For more information, see "},{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"/en/subscriptions-and-notifications/get-started/configuring-notifications#choosing-your-notification-settings"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Configuring notifications"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"h2","properties":{"id":"accessing-your-inbox","tabIndex":-1},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"className":["heading-link"],"href":"#accessing-your-inbox"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Accessing your inbox"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"className":["heading-link-symbol"],"ariaHidden":"true"},"children":[]}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"To access your notifications inbox, in the upper-right corner of any page, click "},{"type":"element","tagName":"svg","properties":{"version":"1.1","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 16 16","className":["octicon","octicon-inbox"],"ariaLabel":"The notifications inbox","role":"img"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"path","properties":{"d":"M2.8 2.06A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 4.41 1h7.18c.7 0 1.333.417 1.61 1.06l2.74 6.395c.04.093.06.194.06.295v4.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 14.25 15H1.75A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 13.25v-4.5c0-.101.02-.202.06-.295Zm1.61.44a.25.25 0 0 0-.23.152L1.887 8H4.75a.75.75 0 0 1 .6.3L6.625 10h2.75l1.275-1.7a.75.75 0 0 1 .6-.3h2.863L11.82 2.652a.25.25 0 0 0-.23-.152Zm10.09 7h-2.875l-1.275 1.7a.75.75 0 0 1-.6.3h-3.5a.75.75 0 0 1-.6-.3L4.375 9.5H1.5v3.75c0 .138.112.25.25.25h12.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25Z"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Your inbox shows all of the notifications that you haven't unsubscribed to or marked as "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Done."}]},{"type":"text","value":" You can customize your inbox to best suit your workflow using filters, viewing all or just unread notifications, and grouping your notifications to get a quick overview."}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"By default, your inbox will show read and unread notifications. To only see unread notifications, click "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Unread"}]},{"type":"text","value":" or use the "},{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"is:unread"}]},{"type":"text","value":" query."}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"h2","properties":{"id":"triaging-options","tabIndex":-1},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"className":["heading-link"],"href":"#triaging-options"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Triaging options"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"className":["heading-link-symbol"],"ariaHidden":"true"},"children":[]}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"You have several options for triaging notifications from your inbox."}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"table","properties":{"ariaLabelledBy":"triaging-options"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"thead","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"tr","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"th","properties":{"scope":"col"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Triaging option"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"th","properties":{"scope":"col"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Description"}]}]}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"tbody","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"tr","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Save"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Saves your notification for later review. To save a notification, to the right of the notification, click "},{"type":"element","tagName":"svg","properties":{"version":"1.1","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 16 16","className":["octicon","octicon-bookmark"],"ariaLabel":"Save","role":"img"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"path","properties":{"d":"M3 2.75C3 1.784 3.784 1 4.75 1h6.5c.966 0 1.75.784 1.75 1.75v11.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.227.579L8 11.722l-3.773 3.107A.751.751 0 0 1 3 14.25Zm1.75-.25a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v9.91l3.023-2.489a.75.75 0 0 1 .954 0l3.023 2.49V2.75a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25Z"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"text","value":". "},{"type":"element","tagName":"br","properties":{},"children":[]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"element","tagName":"br","properties":{},"children":[]},{"type":"text","value":" Saved notifications are kept indefinitely and can be viewed by clicking "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Saved"}]},{"type":"text","value":" in the sidebar or with the "},{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"is:saved"}]},{"type":"text","value":" query. If your saved notification is older than 3 months and becomes unsaved, the notification will disappear from your inbox within a day."}]}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"tr","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Done"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Marks a notification as completed and removes the notification from your inbox. You can see all completed notifications by clicking "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Done"}]},{"type":"text","value":" in the sidebar or with the "},{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"is:done"}]},{"type":"text","value":" query. Notifications marked as "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Done"}]},{"type":"text","value":" are saved for 3 months."}]}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"tr","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Unsubscribe"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Automatically removes the notification from your inbox and unsubscribes you from the conversation until you are @mentioned, a team you're on is @mentioned, or you're requested for review."}]}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"tr","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Read"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Marks a notification as read. To only view read notifications in your inbox, use the "},{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"is:read"}]},{"type":"text","value":" query. This query doesn't include notifications marked as "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Done"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"tr","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Unread"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Marks notification as unread. To only view unread notifications in your inbox, use the "},{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"is:unread"}]},{"type":"text","value":" query."}]}]}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"To see the available keyboard shortcuts, see "},{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"/en/get-started/accessibility/keyboard-shortcuts#notifications"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Keyboard shortcuts"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Before choosing a triage option, you can preview your notification's details first and investigate. For more information, see "},{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"/en/subscriptions-and-notifications/how-tos/viewing-and-triaging-notifications/triaging-a-single-notification"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Triaging a single notification"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"h2","properties":{"id":"triaging-multiple-notifications-at-the-same-time","tabIndex":-1},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"className":["heading-link"],"href":"#triaging-multiple-notifications-at-the-same-time"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Triaging multiple notifications at the same time"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"className":["heading-link-symbol"],"ariaHidden":"true"},"children":[]}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"To triage multiple notifications at once, select the relevant notifications and use the "},{"type":"element","tagName":"svg","properties":{"version":"1.1","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 16 16","className":["octicon","octicon-kebab-horizontal"],"ariaLabel":"More options","role":